    }},
    {{
      title: 'Balance Margin and Velocity by Channel',
      body: `The scatter analysis of profit margin vs. days in inventory reveals a strategic trade-off: channels with the highest margins tend to have longer holding periods. For cash-flow-sensitive operations, prioritize the channel with the best margin-at-velocity combination. The market-wide average holding period is <strong>${{k.avg_days_inventory}} days</strong> with a ${{fmtPct(k.premium_rate)}} resale premium rate — use these as benchmarks to evaluate individual listing performance.`
    }},
    {{
      title: 'Monitor the Resale-to-Retail Ratio Trend',
      body: `The overall resale-to-retail ratio of <strong>${{k.avg_resale_to_retail}}x</strong> indicates that on average, Jordans resell at ${{(k.avg_resale_to_retail * 100 - 100).toFixed(1)}}% ${{k.avg_resale_to_retail >= 1 ? 'above' : 'below'}} retail. Track this ratio over time — a declining trend signals softening secondary demand and warrants reducing inventory exposure. Year-over-year changes in the premium rate (${{fmtPct(k.premium_rate)}} of transactions above retail) are a leading indicator of market health.`
    }}
  ];

